algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: Distance d, observers obs, scale ε
Output: Certified basis B

unseparated ← {(x,y) | d(x,y) > ε}
B ← ∅
while unseparated ≠ ∅:
    o* ← argmax_o |{(x,y) ∈ unseparated | obs(o,x) ≠ obs(o,y)}|
    B ← B ∪ {o*}
    unseparated ← unseparated \ {(x,y) | obs(o*,x) ≠ obs(o*,y)}
return B
